# ===== Bifurc — Rust engine, CLI, MCP server and desktop app =====
# The companion browser extension (`bifurc-extension`) and the website (`bifurc-studio`) are separate
# repositories with their own .gitignore files. `packages/ui-rust` has its own for its target dir.

# ===== Build outputs =====
/target
# `cargo xtask package` writes installers and staged bundles to `release/desktop`.
release/

# ===== Runtime data =====
# The engine's data root when it is run from the repo (`--data-dir ./data`): runtime.json and workspace state.
data/

# ===== Environment files =====
# Build-time keys (see .env.example).
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ===== Logs =====
logs/
*.log

# ===== Certificates =====
# Local dev certs; a test CA named ca.pem may be committed.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cert
!ca.pem

# ===== OS files =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.Trash-*

# ===== Editors =====
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/

# ===== Temporary files =====
*.tmp
*.temp

# ===== Editor / AI assistant artifacts =====
.claude/
claude.md
CLAUDE.md

# ===== Generated screenshots =====
screenshots/
screenshot.png
